/*
 * The icon set, baked.
 *
 * The icons are not drawn one path at a time: they are built out of three
 * primitives - a line that bows a little, a circle that does not quite
 * close, a rounded rectangle whose sides drift - and then every path is
 * resampled and each point pushed off true by a wobble seeded on the
 * icon's own name. So the set is generated, but an icon wobbles the same
 * way every time and no two of them wobble alike.
 *
 * That generator lives in the design file. Running it in the browser to
 * draw a static grid would be a waste, so it was run once and the result
 * is here: `d` is the stroked path, `dot` the round-cap dots, `fill` the
 * solid parts. Coordinates are in a 24x24 box, at one decimal, which is
 * finer than the box can show.
 *
 * To change the drawings, change them in the design file and bake again;
 * editing a path here would only put the two out of step.
 */
